{"id": "34813", "title": "殇璃", "author": "雪灵之", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 86, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34813/34813s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34813.htm", "intro": "碧瓦红墙，御花园中烟波满目。当她带着少女的执拗对他说出，“靖轩哥哥，我喜欢你。”靖轩冷漠地回绝，“可我不喜欢你！”时光流转，经年更迭……再相遇，当年的野蛮格格已蜕变为翩翩淑女。他深情对望说出，“你的丈夫只会是我，我不会再辜负。”她泪眼凝噎：“你早该明白，我已失去爱你的勇气。”她的情深，他总是错过；他的执着，她总是怯步。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34813", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2257949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2257950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2257951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2257952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2257953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2257954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2257955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2257956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2257957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2257958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2257959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2257960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2257961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2257962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2257963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2257964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2257965.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2257966.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2257967.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2257968.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2257969.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2257970.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2257971.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2257972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2257973.html", "available": false